Z||000002||Gokart||03-05-2000||06:50 PM||||I used Rodney's GT wheel center decals for emblems for my scooped quarter window replacements! Took a sheet of lead and painted it the same dark red as my car, slapped a couple of these decals on, carefully cut out the emblem (lead is easy to cut), clear coated them and there you have it! Enraised emblems for my scoops that match the color of my car! They came out beautiful and will be a nice touch. I'll post pics this summer. Also got his third brake light mask! It looks sweet and has me thinking that it could also be used as a stencil for things like custom mud flaps!<p>[This message has been edited by Gokart (edited 03-05-2000).]||||reg||14
